('WO-2026-00003', 'ten_lsp', 'FA-29497', 'open', 'critical', 'BRK-02', 'Brake pad wear below minimum (BRK-02)', 'Opened by orchestrator from vehicle.fault.detected. P-201 reported brake pad wear below minimum (BRK-02), rated critical. Continuing service risks a road call or safety incident, so the vehicle should come out of service. Recommended shop window: Mon 12 Oct 17:03 to Tue 13 Oct 01:03 at North Yard. 1 run(s) fall inside that window, carrying 8 booked riders. A spare vehicle and a qualified driver were found for every affected run.', 'orchestrator', 'North Yard', TIMESTAMP'2026-10-12 17:03:05', TIMESTAMP'2026-10-13 01:03:05', 'wf_2f275301933b', 'lsp-orchestrator-agent/asset', TIMESTAMP'2026-10-12 17:03:05', NULL, NULL, NULL),
